      "writtenOn": "2018-10-10T04:58:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You are putting an object that may contain confidential information (e.g. if this is a WiFi network, the SSID is contained in there and must not be seen by any app that does not have the LOCATION_FINE_GRAINED permission) and putting it in a global broadcast that is public to every app on the device. You can\u0027t do this.",
